{
  "duration": 65.5,
  "sample_rate": 48000,
  "clips": [
    {
      "clip": 0,
      "text": "One hijacker vanished with two hundred thousand dollars. Years later, only fifty-eight hundred came back.",
      "scene": 5,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 8.095,
      "duration": 8.095
    },
    {
      "clip": 1,
      "text": "On November twenty-fourth, nineteen seventy-one, a man using the name Dan Cooper boarded Northwest Orient Flight Three-O-Five. The press later called him D.B.",
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 8.175,
      "end": 21.33,
      "duration": 13.155
    },
    {
      "clip": 2,
      "text": "He claimed his briefcase held a bomb and demanded four parachutes and two hundred thousand dollars.",
      "scene": 1,
      "start": 21.41,
      "end": 26.865,
      "duration": 5.455
    },
    {
      "clip": 3,
      "text": "In Seattle, he released all thirty-six passengers, kept the crew aboard, and ordered the plane south.",
      "scene": 2,
      "start": 26.945,
      "end": 33.54,
      "duration": 6.595
    },
    {
      "clip": 4,
      "text": "Somewhere between Seattle and Reno, Cooper lowered the rear stairs and jumped into a stormy night.",
      "scene": 3,
      "start": 33.62,
      "end": 39.325,
      "duration": 5.705
    },
    {
      "clip": 5,
      "text": "The FBI considered more than eight hundred suspects\u2014but never proved who he was.",
      "scene": 4,
      "start": 39.405,
      "end": 43.44,
      "duration": 4.035
    },
    {
      "clip": 6,
      "text": "Then, in nineteen eighty, a boy found fifty-eight hundred dollars from the ransom. Serial numbers matched. But the money did not show where Cooper landed, or whether he survived.",
      "scene": 5,
      "start": 43.52,
      "end": 54.835,
      "duration": 11.315
    },
    {
      "clip": 7,
      "text": "After forty-five years, the FBI redirected its resources. The identity is still unknown. Did Cooper die in the jump\u2014or escape? The evidence cannot settle it.",
      "scene": 6,
      "start": 54.915,
      "end": 65.5,
      "duration": 10.585
    }
  ],
